<title>CANADA: Canada's Prairies to see sun west, rain east.</title>
<headline>Canada's Prairies to see sun west, rain east.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's Prairies on Monday were forecast to see sun in the west, rain in the east, Environment Canada said.</p>
<p>Alberta should see sun with highs of 17 to 24 Celsius.</p>
<p>Saskatchewan should see sun in the west, showers in the east with highs of 19 to 25 Celsius.</p>
<p>Manitoba should see scattered showers with highs of 20 to 24 Celsius.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
